Description: blazingly fast touch typing academy and syntax tutor for terminal
 kktypr is a terminal-based touch typing tutor and developer code syntax
 trainer written in pure Rust with Ratatui and Crossterm.
 .
 Features:
  * Course 1: Comprehensive touch typing fundamentals (48 lessons)
  * Course 2: Real-world developer code syntax drills (Rust, Python, TS, SQL, Bash)
  * Stationary centered cursor ergonomics preventing eye strain
  * Weak-key heatmap and targeted diagnostic drill generator
  * High-refresh 60 FPS Word Drop arcade mode
  * Atomic XDG state persistence
